        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "That would not work because ssh'd systems cannot read your host system clipboard without you explicitly copy pasting into the terminal via Ctrl + shift + V. \n\nI read into the docs of vim.paste more and realized you can just adopt the first solution of https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/2258, and instead of reading out of the + register, just read out of lines directly.\n\n```lua\n\tvim.paste = function(lines, phase)\n\t\tif MiniPick.is_picker_active() then\n\t\t\treturn paste_into_picker_query(MiniPick, lines)\n\t\tend\n\t\treturn paste_orig(lines, phase)\n\tend\n```\n\nClosing.",
